From: API Demo <api-demo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 04:36:12 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] API Demo: bundle the frontend assets

assets/api_demo/ holds the built page (index.html and assets/); the apply
script copies web/dist there.
---
 app/pubspec.yaml | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/app/pubspec.yaml b/app/pubspec.yaml
index 182116d..cf7ce3c 100644
--- a/app/pubspec.yaml
+++ b/app/pubspec.yaml
@@ -162,6 +162,10 @@ flutter:
     - assets/licenses/lodash-4.17.21-LICENSE.txt
     # Phone layout for the embedded DSH Web (see lib/ui/web/web_view_page.dart).
     - assets/web/
+    # API Demo: the bundled frontend (web/dist of the API Demo repo), served by
+    # lib/api_demo/proxy.dart.
+    - assets/api_demo/
+    - assets/api_demo/assets/
     # Whale-tail activity sprites (lib/ui/chat/widgets/whale_tail.dart),
     # generated by tool/make_whale_sprites.py.
     - assets/whale/
